{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>甜品控注意！尖沙咀新開咗一間充滿意式街頭風情嘅手工雪糕店「Verona Gelato」！店舖主打現代簡約結合復古歐陸風嘅設計，環境格調十足。創辦人特意遠赴意大利深造Gelato傳統配方，仲喺本地自設工場每日新鮮製造Gelato，店內引入了意大利傳統14孔圓桶「Pozzetti」檯面櫃，令雪糕質感做到...</p>\n<p>\n甜品控注意！尖沙咀新開咗一間充滿意式街頭風情嘅手工雪糕店「Verona Gelato」，提供10多款創新及經典口味Gelato！店舖主打現代簡約結合復古歐陸風嘅設計，環境格調十足。創辦人特意遠赴意大利深造Gelato傳統配方，仲喺本地自設工場每日新鮮製造Gelato，店內引入了意大利傳統14孔圓桶「Pozzetti」檯面櫃，令雪糕質感做到最極致嘅滑順綿密。\n</p>\n<h2>尖沙咀新開爆紅Gelato雪糕店！</h2>\n<p>尖沙咀新開咗一間充滿意式街頭風情嘅手工雪糕店「Verona Gelato」，創辦人特意遠赴意大利深造Gelato傳統配方，更仲喺本地自設工場每日新鮮製造Gelato。店內提供10多款創新及經典口味Gelato，人氣款式包括冧酒Tiramisu、開心果、杜拜朱古力、香蕉拖肥批、薄荷脆皮朱古力、芒果拿破崙等，另外仲有特別推介的白桃雪葩、香水檸檬、火腿蜜瓜雪葩。除咗雪糕，亦要試招牌開心果Affogato，熱辣辣且香氣醇厚的Espresso，淋在冰涼綿密嘅開心果雪糕上面，冷熱甜苦交融，簡直是極致享受！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_19533782946af69879328c1-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_19533782946af69879328c1-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_18892498376af6987fdaffe-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_18892498376af6987fdaffe-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_15778609166af69885bb3d1-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_15778609166af69885bb3d1-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_726294506af6988d1d7df-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_726294506af6988d1d7df-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_16843926956af69894e9834-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_16843926956af69894e9834-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18723742206af6989ba4033-1024x1280.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"尖沙咀 Gelato （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18723742206af6989ba4033-1024x1280.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<p><p></p><p>名稱：Verona Gelato</p><p>地址：尖沙咀赫德道11A-11D號地下A3號舖</p><p>#n#：</p></p>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:14.733165+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:58:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:00.716048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:37.234050+00:00","content_hash":"6db4dd879b105cefee3efb6fdf40e7360b6afc82a9fa4e3a6277eaa00c11f9f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}